{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01544","headline":"琴曲歌辞 昭君怨 · 白居易","name":"琴曲歌辞 昭君怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明妃风貌最娉婷，合在椒房应四星。\n只得当年备宫掖，何曾专夜奉帏屏。\n见疎从道迷图画，知屈那教配虏廷。\n自是君恩薄如纸，不须一向恨丹青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}